    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Netflix 韩剧《末路兼职》设定挺有意思，规则怪谈加都市传说，第一集确实抓人。可惜男高开低走，男主遇事只会瞪眼结巴，全靠运气过关，剧情坑越挖越多一个不填。白面小丑、冰箱怪脸这些素材本来能拍好，浪费了。听我们从头捋一遍，比看剧过瘾。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a>:充满规则与逻辑的怪奇之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">00:09:44</a>:命运的转折点：当高利贷、股市输光和家庭困境交织在一起……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">00:14:37</a>:便利店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">00:19:30</a>:小丑的血腥屠杀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">00:24:23</a>:送奶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">00:29:15</a>:电影院</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2341">00:39:01</a>:临床试验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">00:43:53</a>:工地的人骨塔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2924">00:48:44</a>:游乐园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">00:53:36</a>: 后续</span></p><p><span>主播：章鱼 小晖</span></p><p><span>制作：小晖</span></p><p><span>open music Dead-End Job Official Series Intro (Netflix)</span></p><p><span>结尾music 빈 수레 (Empty Cart)  번쩍번쩍 껍데기만 화려한 너에게  KREN </span></p>]]></description>
